 "description": "label_replace adds its label to instant answers, to post-aggregated series and around a bare range function or a `| json` metric (PR for semantics/label-replace-new-label). L1 instant and L2 range are the registry row's form over a sum by; L3 is the transform under topk (ranked after the transform, as Loki evaluates it); L4 is an instant label_replace over a bare count_over_time (one series per stream, not one total); L5 and L6 are the transform over a `| json` metric that drops __error__ (answered by the evaluator that owns JSON parser errors). Run with the control set. L7 and L8 are the rows this change also closes: a label_replace around a binary of two sums on query_range (semantics/label-replace-range-binary-marker) and the instant label_replace around a sum by of the registry request (semantics/label-replace-instant-vector).",
